el. Used to be a voice coach.", "raw_description": {"text": "I teach devs for a living. Author of Total TypeScript and AI Hero. Ex-@vercel. Used to be a voice coach.", "facets": [{"type": "mention", "indices": [70, 77], "original": "vercel", "id": ""}]}, "location": "Oxford, England", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/346640777/1779721449", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1666460461884211204/SmBm505D_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Mon Aug 01 16:08:26 +0000 2011", "protected": false, "website": {"url": "https://aihero.dev", "display_url": "aihero.dev"}, "verification": {"verified": true, "verified_at": null, "type": "individual"}, "type": "profile"}, "replies": 118, "reposts": 244, "likes": 3693, "bookmarks": 1204, "quotes": 40, "embed_card": "summary_large_image", "created_at": "Mon Aug 17 13:01:10 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1786971670, "possibly_sensitive": false, "views": 145136, "is_note_tweet": false, "community_note": null, "lang": "en", "replying_to": null, "media": {"all": [{"type": "photo", "id": "2089336253820887040", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HP7QQMlW4AAjeCL.jpg?name=orig", "width": 1920, "height": 1080}], "photos": [{"type": "photo", "id": "2089336253820887040", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HP7QQMlW4AAjeCL.jpg?name=orig", "width": 1920, "height": 1080}]}, "provider": "twitter", "reposted_by": {"id": "9505092", "name": "Uncle Bob Martin", "screen_name": "unclebobmartin", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2037262183751704577/54AiU968_200x200.jpg", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin"}}, {"type": "status", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin/status/2089140250773696905", "id": "2089140250773696905", "text": "TDD tests are intentional.  They are are \"positive\".  Mutations tests are reactions to testing gaps.  They are negative. \n\nIs there an advantage to a wholly negative test suite?", "raw_text": {"text": "TDD tests are intentional.  They are are \"positive\".  Mutations tests are reactions to testing gaps.  They are negative. \n\nIs there an advantage to a wholly negative test suite?", "display_text_range": [0, 177], "facets": []}, "author": {"screen_name": "unclebobmartin", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin", "id": "9505092", "followers": 282563, "following": 366, "likes": 7447, "media_count": 2721, "statuses": 46580, "name": "Uncle Bob Martin", "description": "Software Craftsman", "raw_description": {"text": "Software Craftsman", "facets": []}, "location": "iPhone: 56.802658,9.868149", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/9505092/1774556131", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2037262183751704577/54AiU968_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Wed Oct 17 19:03:34 +0000 2007", "protected": false, "website": {"url": "http://cleancoder.com", "display_url": "cleancoder.com"}, "verification": {"verified": true, "verified_at": null, "type": "individual"}, "type": "profile"}, "replies": 32, "reposts": 8, "likes": 281, "bookmarks": 86, "quotes": 4, "embed_card": "tweet", "created_at": "Mon Aug 17 00:00:24 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1786924824, "views": 43590, "is_note_tweet": false, "community_note": null, "lang": "en", "replying_to": null, "media": {}, "provider": "twitter", "reposted_by": null}, {"type": "status", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin/status/2088993782477811904", "id": "2088993782477811904", "text": "My son Justin has an interesting idea.  What if you use TDD to get a module working. Then delete all the tests. And then run the mutation tester and kill all the mutants.  Does that make a more efficient test suite?", "raw_text": {"text": "My son Justin has an interesting idea.  What if you use TDD to get a module working. Then delete all the tests. And then run the mutation tester and kill all the mutants.  Does that make a more efficient test suite?", "display_text_range": [0, 215], "facets": []}, "author": {"screen_name": "unclebobmartin", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin", "id": "9505092", "foll